 along with horses to explore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Story mode to follow along.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Side missions and unlockable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Pickup and drop passengers to earn game points.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Supernatural entities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Rich architecture and beauty of Nepal accurately represented.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Geologically accurate Historic Landmarks to explore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Attires to unlock, collect and customize.</p>", "short_description": "Gauley is an open world action-adventure game developed by a solo artist based in Nepal. The vibrant and mysterious world consists of various side missions and a main storyline revolving around the two main protagonists Fulmaya and Aaitey. Discover Nepal, discover Gauley.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687000/c59f29536829f6e7edc7174c07b180a7c544716c/header.jpg?t=1782979109", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687000/afdbbe705ba4b8160e75b6a21c4b1a5b4f7d1f4e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1782979109", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687000/afdbbe705ba4b8160e75b6a21c4b1a5b4f7d1f4e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1782979109", "website": "https://www.youtube.com/@ashimshakyainteractive/videos", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Win 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> i5<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 960  /  AMD Radeon RX 470<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><st